      "id": "sol.amc-10-2001-p5.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Checking each pentomino for a reflection line, exactly six have at least one: the straight bar, the plus, the \\(T\\)-shape, the \\(U\\)-shape, the \\(V\\)-shape, and the \\(W\\)-shape. The remaining six have no line of symmetry.\n\nThus, the correct answer is D.",
